We learn something about the city every day, as we move, explore, and see. I wanted to understand how my experience of Madrid had changed since the day I landed.

I started to keep track of this interaction — a ledger of places I frequented, documented once a week. Over several weeks I had data that showed how I moved and what I remembered about each place. I then used Rhino/Grasshopper to export and analyse that data in a more exploratory, tangible sense.
